// web-search: which sample runtime may call it, with which inputs.
//
// Rendered by terraform/workloads/modules/sample_tools with the gateway ARN
// and the sample runtimes' assumed-role principals. Default-deny engine: a
// runtime not permitted here cannot call searchWeb and does not see it.
//
// The schema bounds the request, and the gateway decides it again here,
// before any call leaves: a query is required and short, at most 10 results,
// page text per result at most 4000 characters. A search costs per call on
// the key's plan, so the bounds are the cost control as well as the shape.
%{ for id, principal in principals ~}
permit(
  principal == AgentCore::IamEntity::"${principal}",
  action == AgentCore::Action::"${target}___searchWeb",
  resource == AgentCore::Gateway::"${gateway_arn}"
) when {
  context.input has query &&
  (!(context.input has numResults) || context.input.numResults <= 10) &&
  (!(context.input has contents) || !(context.input.contents has text) ||
   !(context.input.contents.text has maxCharacters) || context.input.contents.text.maxCharacters <= 4000)
};
%{ endfor ~}
